Booting a Mac's own APFS system without iBoot or a SEP: trust caches loaded once AppleImage4/AMFI register, SIP
policy from the boot-arg lp-sip0, the unauthenticated-root allowance, the Preboot volume mounted for the boot cryptexes,
and the code-signing exceptions amfi_get_out_of_my_way gives locally built code.

